{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "お正月食べるおせちの買い出しをするために近くのスーパーへ向かう両親の背中を追いかけて、｢私も行く！｣ってついて行ってた1年前が懐かしい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今は、大好きな先輩たちの背中を追いかけて、乃木坂46の矢田萌華としてここにいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❄️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お疲れ様です。\n大晦日ですね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このブログを執筆している今現在、\n｢第76回 紅白歌合戦｣の楽屋にいます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "家族以外とはじめて過ごす大晦日は\nなんだか新鮮で、不思議で、変な感じ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただひとつ分かることがあるとすれば、この場にいられることが嬉しいってことだけかも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここにいることは当たり前なんかじゃないんだなって、噛み締めてます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思い返せばこの1年は色んなことがありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2月にお披露目のティザームービーが公開されてから、今日この日に至るまで…\n今ここで振り返るには足りないくらい色んなことが、ありました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobtVMnTZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob3RK0u7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobLLFF60.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobtr2Clu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の実力不足に悔しくなる日の方が多かった気がするけど、、、\n今思えばぜんぶ楽しかった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全部全部、大切な思い出。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年も、この先もずっと\nよろしくお願いいたします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "良いお年をお迎えください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob5fTMvd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "未来はきっと、明るい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生 矢田萌華"}], "source": "official"}